    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP. Use it in the opposing player's Shooting phase, or in any Fight phase, as soon as an enemy unit has picked its targets, on a JAKHALS or GOREMONGERS unit of yours that was chosen as a target for at least one of those attacks. Your unit's models have **[Feel No Pain 6+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** for the rest of the phase, or Feel No Pain 5+ instead while your unit has a WORLD EATERS MONSTER unit of yours within 6\" of it or a WORLD EATERS TITANIC unit of yours within 9\" of it.",
